      "y": 1085,
      "width": 990,
      "height": 100.0,
      "text": "4. Retrieve existing chunks; return evidence through Search -> toolbox -> agent\nThe agent generates its final answer from the tool result. Inspect tool calls and citations.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "textAlign": "left",
